# APK Downloads

APK releases are hosted on GitHub Releases, not in this repository.

After building with Bubblewrap or PWABuilder (see `twa/README.md`), upload the signed APK:

```bash
gh release create v1.0.0 app-release-signed.apk \
  --title "FormLens v1.0.0 Android APK"
```

Then update the download link in `src/routes/install.tsx`:
- Search for `APK_DOWNLOAD_URL`
- Replace the placeholder with your GitHub Releases asset URL

## Why not in the repo?

- Binary files bloat git history permanently
- Signed APKs contain the app's digital signature — the keystore must stay secret
- GitHub Releases provides versioning, download counts, and CDN delivery

